From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:19:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Customer app: payment history (Orders / Payments switch) +
 bot payment mirror

- bot/payment-sync.js mirrors paymentStatus/method/paidAt onto customers/{phone}/orders/{id} on every order change (idempotent, never creates a record)
- loyalty accrual now merges the customer's order record instead of replacing it
- Orders tab: Orders | Payments switch, paid / to-pay totals, per-order payment details
- tests: payment-sync.check.cjs, direct-mode payments scenario

